# HTML conventions

- Keep semantic landmarks, labeled controls, logical headings, and 44px touch targets.
- Icon-only buttons need specific accessible names.
- Preserve the manifest, theme metadata, strict CSP, and PDF.js SRI.
- Keep PDF.js script and worker versions aligned.
- Do not claim HTTP-only security headers through meta tags.
